@startuml
!include theme.puml
title Asset movement | Aggregate stock invariant
start
:Authorize admin/super-admin;\napply tenant context;
:SELECT asset FOR UPDATE;
if (Asset exists?) then (no)
  :404;
  stop
endif
:assigned = SUM(quantity_delta)\nwhere employee_id IS NOT NULL;
if (employee_id supplied?) then (yes)
  :next_assigned = assigned + delta;
  if (0 <= next_assigned <= total_quantity?) then (no)
    :409 Excess return or insufficient stock;
    stop
  endif
else (general stock)
  :next_total = total_quantity + delta;
  if (next_total >= 0 AND next_total >= assigned?) then (no)
    :409 Invalid stock adjustment;
    stop
  endif
  :Update asset.total_quantity;
endif
:INSERT AssetMovement\nasset, employee?, delta, reason;
:COMMIT; release asset lock;
stop
note right
Employee-linked positive delta = assign out.
Employee-linked negative delta = return.
Unlinked delta changes total stock.
Current check is aggregate, not per employee.
No asset-management frontend screen is implemented.
end note
@enduml
